teltools
--------
Indic transliteration is built on teltools, Copyright 2026 Pradyumna Revur,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://github.com/revurpk/teltools). It is vendored in
third_party/teltools with its LICENSE and NOTICE; the Akshara contributors'
modifications are listed in third_party/teltools/PATCHES.md.

